  "worked_solution": "First, we add a column for $\u00acB,$ where the truth values are opposite to the corresponding values in the column for $B.$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,\u00acB\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nThen, we add a column for $A\u2227\u00acB.$ Remember that $A\u2227\u00acB$ is true if both $\u00acB$ and $A$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,\u00acB\\,$ | $\\,A\u2227\u00acB\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nFinally, we add a column for $\u00ac(A\u2227\u00acB).$ Remember that the truth values of $\u00ac(A\u2227\u00acB)$ are opposite those of $A\u2227\u00acB.$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,\u00acB\\,$ | $\\,A\u2227\u00acB\\,$ | $\\,\u00ac(A\u2227\u00acB)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |",
